{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774236221067,"story":{"title":"Rory's Big Trip","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"eric-carle","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"collage_mixed","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Rory was a small dragon. He was green and cute. Rory had a big wish. He wants to fly.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, green dragon named Rory looks up at the sky with hopeful, wide eyes. He is standing in a field of bright yellow flowers. The sky is blue with fluffy white clouds. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Style: Eric Carle.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774236125696,"durationMs":5024,"retries":0,"promptLength":674,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small emerald green scales with a pale yellow belly and small orange dorsal spikes dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with hopeful/wishful expression, Small, underdeveloped wings, A slightly oversized head for his body, A tiny puff of smoke that occasionally comes out of his nostrils, A small, slightly wobbly tail, chubby build. Rory, a small, green, and cute dragon, looks up longingly at the sky, clearly wanting to fly. in A sunny spot in the rolling green meadow.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Rory tried to fly. He flapped his wings hard. He jumped up high. But he could not fly up.","illustrationPrompt":"Rory is flapping his tiny wings with all his might, jumping in the air but not getting very high. His face shows determination. The background is a green hill with a bright red sun. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Style: Eric Carle.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774236125391,"durationMs":4715,"retries":0,"promptLength":654,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textu